2026-05-27 15:05:49,759 | AGENT | SecurityCompliance Agent answered: To comply with GDPR regulations and ensure the required security controls are in place, we will rely on our existing ISO 27001 certification, which covers the design, development, and operation of AI-powered information systems. Our standard data residency is already set to EU only, and our cross-border transfer policy prohibits data transfers outside the EU unless there's an explicit legal basis.

